      "Hallucinate will cast from wherever Shaco is at the end of the cast time.",
      "When Shaco dies, the clone will automatically target the closest visible enemy champion within 1500 units.",
      "The clone will always spawn in the opposite direction of the cursor.\n  - If Deceive and Hallucinate are used in quick succession, the clone will spawn in the direction of the cursor instead."
